    "Create the key in Unraid under Settings › Management Access › API Keys. It is stored in this device's Keychain and sent only to your gateway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أنشئ المفتاح في Unraid من Settings › Management Access › API Keys. يُحفظ في سلسلة مفاتيح هذا الجهاز ويُرسل إلى بوابتك فقط."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erstelle den Schlüssel in Unraid unter Settings › Management Access › API Keys. Er wird im Schlüsselbund dieses Geräts gespeichert und nur an dein Gateway gesendet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea la clave en Unraid en Settings › Management Access › API Keys. Se guarda en el llavero de este dispositivo y solo se envía a tu gateway."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Créez la clé dans Unraid sous Settings › Management Access › API Keys. Elle est stockée dans le trousseau de cet appareil et envoyée uniquement à votre passerelle."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea la chiave in Unraid in Settings › Management Access › API Keys. Viene salvata nel portachiavi di questo dispositivo e inviata solo al tuo gateway."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Unraid 的 Settings › Management Access › API Keys 中创建密钥。密钥保存在本设备的钥匙串中，只会发送给你的网关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
